, Minister? Then the crown will be the best thing I ever made.”\", \"“是司徒府上自家的珠子？那这顶冠，便是我一生最好的手艺。”\", \"ef93e8f4ed64\"]]"},{"name":"given","type":"string","value":"[[\"n\", \"“That crown was the best work of my life. I hope it went to someone worth it.”\", \"“那顶冠是我平生最好的活计。但愿戴它的人配得上。”\", \"2330990397ed\"]]"}]},{"id":45,"name":"exit-changan","type":"exit","x":160,"y":160,"width":32,"height":16,"rotation":0,"visible":true,"properties":[{"name":"to","type":"string","value":"changan"},{"name":"side","type":"string","value":"S"}]},{"id":46,"name":"entry-changan","type":"entry","x":168.0,"y":158.4,"width":0,"height":0,"rotation":0,"visible":true,"point":true,"properties":[{"name":"from","type":"string","value":"changan"}]},{"id":47,"name":"entry","type":"entry","x":168.0,"y":158.4,"width":0,"height":0,"rotation":0,"visible":true,"point":true}]}]}